's minimum height exceeds the allowed limit. Buildings must not exceed 1000 meters or the zoning requirement for maximum height. To fix this, adjust the minimum number of floors or the floor-to-floor height.",q,j6,q,"Error message shown when the user has entered a height for a building input that is too large."),j7,A.a("Building name is required.",q,j7,q,"Error message shown when the user has not entered a name for a building input."),j8,A.a("Community building",q,j8,q,"In the Earth real estate development tools, there is a dialog showing various building types. This is the name of a building template type that is a community building."),j9,A.a("Building",q,j9,q,"In the Earth real estate development tools, there is a dialog showing various building types. This is the name of a building template type that is unspecified so it references a default building."),k0,A.a("High-rise hotel on podium",q,k0,q,"In the Earth real estate development tools, there is a dialog showing various building types. This is the name of a building template type that is a high rise hotel on a podium. A podium in a building is the base or platform of the structure, made up of the ground and lower levels."),k1,A.a("High-rise multifamily on street",q,k1,q,"In the Earth real estate development tools, there is a dialog showing various building types. This is the name of a building template type that is a high rise multifamily building on a street."),k2,A.a("High-rise multifamily on podium",q,k2,q,"In the Earth real estate development tools, there is a dialog showing various building types. This is the name of a building template type that is a high rise multifamily building on a podium. A podium in a building is the base or platform of the structure, made up of the ground and lower levels."),k3,A.a("High-rise multifamily tower on podium",q,k3,q,"In the Earth real estate development tools, there is a dialog showing various building types. This is the name of a building template type that is a high rise multifamily tower on a podium. A podium in a building is the base or platform of the structure, made up of the ground and lower levels."),k4,A.a("High-rise multifamily on wrapped podium",q,k4,q,'In the Earth real estate development tools, there is a dialog showing various building types. This is the name of a building template type that is a high rise multifamily building on a wrapped podium. A wrapped podium in building construction refers to a building type where a parking structure or other base structure (the podium) is "wrapped" or surrounded by residential, commercial, or other functional spaces.'),k5,A.a("High-rise commercial office",q,k5,q,"In the Earth real estate development tools, there is a dialog showing various building types. This is the name of a building template type that is a high rise commercial office."),k6,A.a("Life sciences building",q,k6,q,"In the Earth real estate development tools, there is a dialog showing various building types. This is the name of a building template type that is a life sciences building."),k7,A.a("Low-mid multifamily",q,k7,q,"In the Earth real estate development tools, there is a dialog showing various building types. This is the name of a building template type that is a low mid rise multifamily building."),k8,A.a("Low-mid multifamily with retail",q,k8,q,"In the Earth real estate development tools, there is a dialog showing various building types. This is the name of a building template type that is a low mid rise multifamily building with retail space."),k9,A.a("Low-mid commercial office",q,k9,q,"In the Earth real estate development tools, there is a dialog showing various building types. This is the name of a building template type that is a low mid rise commercial office."),l0,A.a("Low-mid commercial office with retail",q,l0,q,"In the Earth real estate development tools, there is a dialog showing various building types. This is the name of a building template type that is a low mid rise commercial office with retail space."),l1,A.a("Low-rise multifamily rowhouse",q,l1,q,"In the Earth real estate development tools, there is a dialog showing various building types. This is the name of a building template type that is a low rise multifamily rowhouse. A rowhouse is a multilevel house attached to an adjacent house, with those houses being of uniform size and general appearance."),l2,A.a("Low-rise multifamily tower",q,l2,q,"In the Earth real estate development tools, there is a dialog showing various building types. This is the name of a building template type that is a low rise multifamily tower. A tower is a type of structure that is tall in proportion to the size of its base, often by a considerable margin."),l3,A.a("Mid-rise hotel on street",q,l3,q,"In the Earth real estate development tools, there is a dialog showing various building types. This is the name of a building template type that is a mid rise hotel on a street."),l4,A.a("Mid-rise multifamily courtyard",q,l4,q,"In the Earth real estate development tools, there is a dialog showing various building types. This is the name of a building template type that is a mid rise multifamily courtyard. A courtyard is an open-air space within a building that's enclosed on three or four sides"),l5,A.a("Mid-rise multifamily on street",q,l5,q,"In the Earth real estate development tools, there is a dialog showing various building types. This is the name of a building template type that is a mid rise multifamily building on a street."),l6,A.a("Mid-rise commercial office",q,l6,q,"In the Earth real estate development tools, there is a dialog showing various building types. This is the name of a building template type that is a mid rise commercial office."),l7,A.a("Mid-rise commercial on podium",q,l7,q,"In the Earth real estate development tools, there is a dialog showing various building types. This is the name of a building template type that is a mid rise commercial office on a podium. A podium in a building is the base or platform 