ser. This text is meant to indicate that the user focuses on the freshwater (e.g. rivers, estuaries, groundwater) industry.",Xh:"Text for a radio button in a survey about the area or industry of focus for an Earth user. This text is meant to indicate that the user focuses on the health care / social work industry.",PN:"Text for a radio button in a survey about the area or industry of focus for an Earth user. This text is meant to indicate that the user focuses on the housing & urban development industry.",Na:"Text for a radio button in a survey about the area or industry of focus for an Earth user. This text is meant to indicate that the user focuses on the human rights industry.",PU:"Text for a radio button in a survey about the area or industry of focus for an Earth user. This text is meant to indicate that the user focuses on the humanitarian aid industry.",XR:"Text for a radio button in a survey about the area or industry of focus for an Earth user. This text is meant to indicate that the user focuses on the indigenous rights and interests industry.",MF:"Text for a radio button in a survey about the area or industry of focus for an Earth user. This text is meant to indicate that the user focuses on the industrial goods & manufacturing industry.",S8:"Text for a radio button in a survey about the area or industry of focus for an Earth user. This text is meant to indicate that the user focuses on the insurance industry.",PS:"Text for a radio button in a survey about the area or industry of focus for an Earth user. This text is meant to indicate that the user focuses on the journalism & media industry.",fI:"Text for a radio button in a survey about the area or industry of focus for an Earth user. This text is meant to indicate that the user focuses on the land and coastal ecosystems management & conservation industry.",J_:"Text for a radio button in a survey about the area or industry of focus for an Earth user. This text is meant to indicate that the user focuses on the land rights industry.",RY:"Text for a radio button in a survey about the area or industry of focus for an Earth user. This text is meant to indicate that the user focuses on the local rides & mobility industry.",f5:"Text for a radio button in a survey about the area or industry of focus for an Earth user. This text is meant to indicate that the user focuses on the manufacturing & industrial industry.",ys:"Text for a radio button in a survey about the area or industry of focus for an Earth user. This text is meant to indicate that the user focuses on the methane detection industry.",t0:"Text for a radio button in a survey about the area or industry of focus for an Earth user. This text is meant to indicate that the user focuses on the mining/quarrying industry.",_J:"Text for a radio button in a survey about the area or industry of focus for an Earth user. This text is meant to indicate that the user focuses on the natural disasters / climate risk industry.",rO:"Text for a radio button in a survey about the area or industry of focus for an Earth user. This text is meant to indicate that the user focuses on the nature-based solutions (e.g. voluntary carbon market, carbon removals, monitoring, reporting and verification) industry.",W1:"Text for a radio button in a survey about the area or industry of focus for an Earth user. This text is meant to indicate that the user focuses on the navigation & mobility industry.",vu:"Text for a radio button in a survey about the area or industry of focus for an Earth user. This text is meant to indicate that the user focuses on the oceans ecosystems & conservation industry.",Ao:"Text for a radio button in a survey about the area or industry of focus for an Earth user. This text is meant to indicate that the user focuses on the public health industry.",DB:"Text for a radio button in a survey about the area or industry of focus for an Earth user. This text is meant to indicate that the user focuses on the real estate development 